  "steps": [
    "Heat oil in a Kadai.",
    "Add Mustard seeds, jeera, urad dal saute For one minute in medium flame.",
    "Now add dry chilli, Green chilli, Curry leaf saute for 30 secs in high flames.",
    "Add onion and saute for 3 mins in high flame.",
    "Add tomato and saute for 2 mins.",
    "Now add Lauki cubes, Masala, Salt and mix it all for 2 mins in High flame.",
    "Now add Water, mix it well and cover it.",
    "Let it cook for 5 mins in medium flame.",
    "Open it and check whether it’s cooked right or not.",
    "Now add middle garlic and muddle peanuts.",
